1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,630
I surprisingly found quite a few things.
出乎意料，我找到了不少东西。

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:07,030
This top is really cute I actually kind of like it with the bow untied too.
这件上衣很可爱，我甚至还挺喜欢把蝴蝶结解开的样子。

3
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,480
It's just very lightweight.
它真的很轻薄。

4
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:13,190
And I've been into stripes which is obvious because I also tried on this tank top.
而且最近我很喜欢条纹，这很明显，因为我还试了这件无袖背心。

5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:18,000
Which is all right like I don't know I don't think there's anything special about it.
这件还行，但我不知道，感觉也没什么特别的。

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,440
I couldn't tell if this was cute on the rack so I figured I might as well just try it on.
在衣架上看不出它好不好看，所以我想，不如试一下。

7
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:29,200
And while I like the cut of it I don't know if the pattern is necessarily my taste.
虽然我喜欢它的剪裁，但不确定这个图案是否合自己的口味。

8
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:35,360
It reminds me of something like my aunt would wear in the 2000 s in a non derogatory way obviously.
它让我想到阿姨在2000年代会穿的衣服，当然，我没有贬低的意思。

9
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:38,870
This dress was calling to me mostly because of the rosette detail on the shoulder.
这条裙子很吸引我，主要因为肩上的玫瑰花饰细节。

10
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:44,320
And I'm a sucker for rosettes but I just don't think this was really doing anything for me.
我很容易被玫瑰花饰打动，但这件裙子穿在我身上好像没什么效果。

11
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:50,320
And I don't see myself wearing it but especially during summer like this is not a summer dress.
我也想象不出自己会穿它，尤其是夏天；这根本不是夏季裙子。

12
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:51,920
These capries were so bad.
这条七分裤也太糟糕了。

13
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:56,550
I want a pair of black capries that flare out a bit and I thought these could be that.
我想要一条裤脚稍微喇叭展开的黑色七分裤，以为这条就是。

14
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:59,519
But they were so tight on me even though they were my size.
但它穿在我身上特别紧，明明标的是我的尺码。

15
00:00:59,519 --> 00:01:05,120
Which just goes to show you that women's sizing is ass and they were just really bad so bad.
这只能说明女装尺码真糟心，穿起来太差了，真的很差。

16
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:08,160
Okay that very surprisingly was not as much of a flop.
好了，出乎意料，这次倒没有那么失败。

17
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:13,760
I did manage to find like five cute items I didn't love how they all fit on me.
我确实找到了大概五件可爱的单品，只是不都喜欢它们穿在身上的样子。

18
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:16,880
As you can see but it's something.
大家也看到了，但至少算有点收获。

19
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:22,710
I did ask the universe for just one thing and I found one thing or at least I got one thing.
我确实向宇宙许愿，只要一件就好，也找到了——或者至少买到了一件。

20
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:26,710
Okay I'm thinking I'm going to hit maybe one or two more thrift stores.
接下来我想再逛一家或者两家旧衣店。

21
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:32,630
Because I don't want this to be like all my other thrift with me where I spend 3 days thrifting just to find nothing.
我不想像以前那些陪我淘衣的视频一样，逛了三天却什么都没找到。

22
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:35,280
Like I'm going to hit four thrift stores in this video.
这个视频里我就逛四家旧衣店。

23
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:40,560
And whatever I get I get and if I don't find anything so be it.
淘到多少算多少，如果什么都没有，那就这样吧。

24
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:46,000
Since I was going to bigger chain thrift stores I decided to go to a smaller one.
之前一直逛比较大的连锁旧衣店，所以我决定去一家小一点的。

25
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:50,160
But the largest size on a lot of the racks were an extra large.
但许多衣架上，最大的尺码只有加大码。

26
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:55,519
And a lot of the clothes weren't my taste which is honestly fair because that's just the gamble you take when you're thrifting.
很多衣服也不合我的喜好，不过这很正常，淘衣本来就是碰运气。

27
00:01:55,519 --> 00:01:57,280
A lot of the clothes won't be your taste.
很多衣服就是不会合你的口味。

28
00:01:57,280 --> 00:02:02,079
They did have a triple xx size marker but they did not have any clothes in that section.
他们有一个三加大码的尺码牌，但那个区域根本没有衣服。

29
00:02:02,079 --> 00:02:04,079
Which sucks if you are a size 3 x.
如果你穿三加大码，这真的很难受。

30
00:02:04,079 --> 00:02:10,000
Because then a lot of the time you just don't have any or at least many options to choose from.
因为很多时候，你根本没得选，或者至少可选的东西非常少。

31
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:15,040
And I think that's something a lot of thinner people can't fathom when they tell plus sized people.
我觉得很多身形较瘦的人无法体会这一点，却会告诉大码人士……

32
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:18,239
That there are a bunch of cute options at thrift stores for us.
说旧衣店里有一大堆适合我们的可爱衣服。

33
00:02:18,239 --> 00:02:24,000
Is that sometimes or a lot of the time thrift stores don't even have anything in our size.
可事实上，有时甚至很多时候，旧衣店连我们的尺码都没有。

34
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:28,239
Or they don't have many things they have maybe 10 items or less.
或者数量很少，也许只有十件甚至更少。

35
00:02:28,239 --> 00:02:30,480
And I'm not trying to paint everyone with a wide brush.
我也不是想把所有人一概而论。

36
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:34,480
I know smaller people have problems finding clothes too.
我知道身形较小的人找衣服也会遇到困难。

37
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:41,280
My boyfriend is a petite fitted man so he can almost never find anything that fits him.
我的男朋友身形很小巧，几乎也找不到合身的衣服。

38
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:44,880
Which is interesting because we're both at like opposite ends of the spectrum.
这很有意思，因为我们恰好在身形范围的相反两端。

39
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:47,760
With me being a tall plus siz woman.
我则是一个个子很高的大码女性。

40
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:51,269
So we bond over the lack of options we both have.
我们也会因为彼此都缺少选择而产生共鸣。

41
00:02:51,279 --> 00:02:57,679
And just how annoying and difficult it is to find clothes that fit you and make you feel good.
找到既合身又让自己感觉好的衣服，真的既烦人又困难。

42
00:02:57,679 --> 00:03:04,240
I'm not sure if you can tell but I tried to give myself a little bit of a homemade him cut.
不知道你们看不看得出来，我试着自己剪了一点所谓的姬发式。

43
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:10,640
Hime cut I don't exactly know what it's called oh my bad.
Hime cut？我也不太确定叫什么。啊，是我说错了。

44
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:15,039
It's not a super clear on my hair cuz I don't have straight hair.
在我头发上不太明显，因为我不是直发。

45
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:18,080
But maybe I need to cut more or maybe I could have done it better.
也许该再剪一点，也可能我本来能剪得更好。

46
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:21,920
But I was tired of my hair and wanted something different.
我只是对原来的头发腻了，想换点不一样的。

47
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:27,260
But now the downside is when I wear my hair up I look like a founding father.
可缺点是，我一把头发扎起来，就像美国开国元勋。
